    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061221.0099\n\nLONDON, Dec 21 , 2006, 2006\n\nEuropean shares fall at open: London FTSE down 0.16 percent\n\n\n\n\nEuropean stock markets declined in early trading on Thursday, with London's FTSE 100 index of leading shares losing 0.16 percent to reach 6,188.70 points.\n\nIn Frankfurt the DAX 30 index shed 0.21 percent to 6,573.37 points and in Paris the CAC 40 lost 0.27 percent in value to 5,499.43.",
